2. DO NOT FLAG: a hedged, checkable statement of the same intent, for example {{ hook_claims_examples_accepted }}. Hedging plus a checkable observation (「往往」 / 「大多数人」 / 「会比想象中顺」 / 「少走弯路」) is the approved shape: it promises effort and process, never a guaranteed result.
